{
  "_doc": "Public booking Step-3 gating (Step3CustomerForm: canBook = firstName trimmed >= 2 && isValidPersonName(firstName) && lastName empty-or-valid && isValidGeorgianPhone(phone) && consent). Driven by e2e/data-driven/booking-customer.spec.ts. The spec reaches Step 3 once, then applies each case's full field set. 'valid' = book-submit enabled. Never submitted — the end-to-end booking lives in booking.spec.ts.",
  "meta": { "firstNameMin": 2, "notesMax": 500 },
